Z||000004||Cliff Pennock||11-03-2000||03:31 AM||||Server is running fine... It could be that somewhere beween your computer and my server a router is acting up. Next time it happens, note the date and time (so I can check my logs to make sure it isn't my server), and do a traceroute to my server. To do a traceroute, open a MSDos box, and type<P>tracert <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl</A>  <P>That should tell you exactly where the problem is.<p>[This message has been edited by Cliff Pennock (edited 11-03-2000).]||||reg||1
